@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

title Proposed optimizer boundary (design only, not implemented)
start
:Parse, type check, resolve names /\nenums / next-state (existing mandatory checks);
:1. Immutable typed semantic IR + source mapping\n+ constraint effects + validation results\n(original executable kept as fallback);
:2. Optional typed SMT property checks\n(explicit domains and assumptions);
:3. BDD candidate only for eligible\npure, total Boolean regions;
:4. Independent equivalence and\ncertificate check;
if (Obligation established?) then (yes)
  :Use checked candidate\n+ transformation/proof relations;
else (SAT mismatch, Unknown, timeout,\ninvalid certificate, ...)
  :Keep unchanged original\n+ bounded skip reason / diagnostic;
endif
:5. Emit final bytecode, check resource bounds,\nvalidate provenance relations;
stop
@enduml
